Package: recurSurvTests
Type: Package
Title: Reference Methods for Recurrent Gap-Time Survival and Recurrent Competing Risks
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "John",
    family = "Muschelli",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "muschellij2@gmail.com"
  )
Description: Reference implementations of nonparametric methods for recurrent
    gap-time survival and recurrent competing risks. Included methods are a
    Wang-Chang / weighted-risk-set survival estimator, the Luo-Huang recurrent
    gap-time rank test (including the rho = 0 log-rank analogue), the
    Sivadasan-Sankaran recurrent cumulative-incidence estimator, and a
    subject-bootstrap Wald reconstruction of the Sivadasan-Sankaran equal-cause
    recurrent cumulative-incidence test. The implementations are intended to be
    transparent and research-oriented; users should validate them against the
    source papers and application-specific assumptions before production use.
